{"id": "14-2609-6-9", "zh": "昨日过去时用于从昨天起、亲眼所见的过去。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2610-2-25", "zh": "428,468. 今日过去时：ī uṃ、o ttha、iṃ mhā、ā ū、se vhaṃ、aṃ mhe。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2611-2-24", "zh": "ī uṃ、o ttha、iṃ mhā、ā ū、se vhaṃ、aṃ mhe 这十二个词尾，有“今日过去时”这一名称。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2612-2-5", "zh": "称为“今日过去时”有什么用？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2612-6-7", "zh": "今日过去时用于临近的过去。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2613-2-25", "zh": "429,472. 未来时：ssati ssanti、ssasi ssatha、ssāmi ssāma、ssate ssante、ssase ssavhe、ssaṃ ssāmhe。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "14-2614-2-26", "zh": "ssati ssanti、ssasi ssatha、ssāmi ssāma、ssate ssante、ssase ssavhe、ssaṃ ssāmhe 这十二个词尾，有“未来时”这一名称。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "14-2615-2-5", "zh": "称为“未来时”有什么用？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2615-6-8", "zh": "未来时用于未来。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2616-2-26", "zh": "430,373. 条件式：ssā ssaṃsu、sse ssatha、ssaṃ ssāmhā、ssatha sissu、ssase ssavhe、ssiṃ ssāmhase。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2617-2-26", "zh": "ssā ssaṃsu、sse ssatha、ssaṃ ssāmhā、ssatha ssisu、ssase ssavhe、ssiṃ ssāmhase 这十二个词尾，有“条件式”这一名称。", "confidence": 78}
